The `assignPointsToClassroom` function assigns points to classrooms that showcase the most creative recycling solutions. It checks if the item brought by the classroom is valid and not already brought by the classroom before.
The `getStudentPoints` function returns the number of unique items brought by a student. If a student brings all the items on the list, they are awarded one point.
The `getClassroomPoints` function returns the number of unique items brought by a classroom. If a classroom brings all the items on the list, they are awarded one point.
