We will consider the socio-economic impact of the project on the local community and the environmental sustainability of the proposed solution. This will involve working with local farmers to ensure that the project meets their needs and that they are able to benefit from the increased crop yield. We will also ensure that the project is environmentally sustainable by minimizing water wastage and using eco-friendly materials in the custom irrigation system.
